{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">近日因參加《女神配對計劃2》而人氣急升的俞可程，日前在社交平台大晒兩張於深水埗嘉頓山拍攝的日落靚相。她更透露這兩張照片的拍攝時間足足相隔了 8 年，驚人的對比隨即引來大批網民的關注與熱烈討論！</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">從相中可見，8 年前的俞可程留著一頭及肩短髮並配上齊劉海，散發出滿滿的文青少女氣息。而 8 年後的她可謂「女大十八變」，換上一頭迷人長捲髮與精緻的妝容，甜美氣質與女人味瞬間爆燈，零死角的超高顏值相當吸睛！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d56db7ef-d5da-4f09-b1ff-96d768c359f3.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20269f4ffVFXq21790588678.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d56db7ef-d5da-4f09-b1ff-96d768c359f3.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"805ac733-5b60-4b69-ba63-145da305a0b3.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026khcsPNsNzA1790588678.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"805ac733-5b60-4b69-ba63-145da305a0b3.jpg.webp\"/></div></div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">時隔 8 年再次重遊舊地，俞可程亦不禁有感而發，在帖文中感性寫道：「People always come and go, but the right ones will always stay. （人們總是來來去去，但對的人總會留在身邊。）」唯美的日落景色配上充滿感悟的留言，極具意境。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T10:19:13.441809+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":343,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}